# Web Application Development Standards

- Enforce TypeScript strict mode without implicit `any`.
- Structure components using feature-driven architecture (`src/features/[feature]/...`).
- Separate server state (TanStack Query / Server Components) from global client state (Zustand).
- Validate all user inputs and external API responses with Zod schemas.
- Ensure all interactive elements meet WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility standards.
